- !<ScriptComponent/6909e61b-b6c2-4889-aa1f-756e128188d8>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: ExampleCarousel
  Enabled: true
  ScriptAsset: !<reference> 7c1c7a17-84b0-5179-bf92-c37fa689d145
  ScriptInputsDefault:
    startIndex: true
    previousLabel: true
    nextLabel: true
    examplesPushBack: true
    anchorExamples: true
    startMinimized: true
    extraPanelDrop: true
  ScriptTypesDefault:
    {}
  ScriptInputs:
    "":
      examples: !<reference.SceneObject[]>
        - !<reference> ee2857f2-c91d-4adf-b93e-3b529c7af0c6
      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - Solvers keep content placed relative to a target. The red Head pose sphere stands in for your head and moves on its own; the blue content reacts through each solver.
      steps: !<reference.SceneObject[]>
        - !<reference> 59993ce0-bb9f-4cb4-6531-7594b05dea87
        - !<reference> 955cc3d1-731e-40ba-4a03-3a18f386cf37
        - !<reference> cd6cd492-8d11-4953-60fa-5964d1642380
        - !<reference> 0a5531a7-268f-49a0-6566-c54d0b110774
        - !<reference> 8a5c54fd-58b2-4057-7a4e-c88012228197
        - !<reference> 9aae7e5b-fcbc-49f8-5a98-e70055b87ce0
        - !<reference> 2cf12f7f-b2a0-4c00-5920-d3cfd834b474
        - !<reference> b4fcea1d-0018-470e-7b58-fd2cd4737446
        - !<reference> 3eb826b5-ec31-4b1f-4cec-c5bb90abb70d
      stepInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Billboard keeps the blue content turned toward its target: it faces the red Head pose as the head sways and turns."
        - "Look At points the blue object at its target: it keeps aiming at the moving Head pose."
        - "Match Transform makes the blue cube follow its target with an offset: it stays just below the Head pose."
        - 'Sharp Turn detects sudden changes of direction: the Head pose zigzags and "Sharp turn!" flashes at each turn.'
        - "Scale Over Distance resizes the blue content with the distance to its target: it grows and shrinks as the Head pose moves nearer and further."
        - "In Between Rotation turns the blue object to a rotation halfway between two targets: the Head pose and the second box."
        - Tether keeps the blue content in front of the Head pose and catches up when the head turns away.
        - Tether Between Angle Range only moves the blue content once the Head pose turns past an angle; small turns leave it in place.
        - Distance Events fire callbacks when the Head pose crosses distance thresholds from the cube below it; each event is printed to the logs.
      startIndex: !<float> 0.000000
      previousLabel: Previous
      nextLabel: Next
      examplesPushBack: !<float> 20.000000
      anchorExamples: true
      startMinimized: false
      extraPanelDrop: !<float> 0.000000
  ScriptTypes:
    "":
      {}
